  "2026-10-04 event venues": "25 newsletter venue records folded into the record the catalogue already held for the same place. Each pair checked by name, written address and pin. The newsletter record had been created when the strict venue match missed the existing one, so the place's events sat on a pinless copy. Also Old Chiang Mai Cultural Center into its Overture row at 185/3 Wualai Rd. Keo Park and Cowboy Army keep the newsletter record, which now carries a sourced pin. Not folded, and why: Wat Aranyawas Ban Pong (the near match is pinned in the old city under a highway-108 address), Anantara's Nimman Overture row (wrong pin)."
